type: software
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
title: "Local AI for specimen features"
message: "If you use this software or its saved examples, please cite this repository."
abstract: >-
  Code and saved evidence for Agentic AI Systems for Specimen Interaction and
  Camera-Based Observation. Includes local vision-model analysis, image-linked
  feature graphs, the OpenScan-based scanner workflow and five original scans.
  Software is MIT licensed. Jack Dan Hollister's photographs are CC BY 4.0;
  third-party photographs retain their individual credits and licences.
